title: Pi-Top
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

A laptop-style case built around a [[Raspberry Pi]]. The original is a fluorescent green matte plastic wedge.

Its stock operating system was pi-topOS Polaris. Pi-Top stopped supporting and distributing Polaris in favor of newer versions (Sirius, then Further), so it is no longer officially downloadable. See [[Pi-Top's post on the new pi-topOS|https://www.pi-top.com/blog/new-pi-topos]].

In summer 2018 it became the control station for an [[AxiDraw]] in [[Pi-Top + AxiDraw = Libre Drawing Machine]], running a minimal [[Raspbian]] and [[OpenBox]] instead of Polaris.

This was maybe ≈2018

They no longer make the laptop case, they've gone to other things, despite keeping the name!
